===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=cease-and-desist|?}}

# {{lb|en|legal|mostly|attributive}} A written demand that a party stops and does not resume a certain behavior, such as [[copyright infringement]], [[slander]], or [[libel]], threatening legal action if the recipient fails to do so.
#: {{ux|en|She received a '''cease-and-desist''' letter from his solicitors soon after the podcast.}}
# {{lb|en|US|legal|mostly|attributive}} An order by a government agency, [[sanction]]ed by a court, that one must stop and not resume a certain (usually illegal) behavior.
#: {{ux|en|His remarks did not stop the courts from issuing the '''cease-and-desist''' order.}}<!-- https://www.law.cornell.edu/wex/cease_and_desist_order -->

